  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Published on occasion of "Follow-Ed  (after Hokusai)" an exhibition curated by Tom Sowden and Michalis Pichler travelling to Gallery P74, Ljubljana, Slovenia, Winchester Gallery, University of Southhampton, Arnolfini, Bristol and other places.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
