  <datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"Six hands and a cheese sandwich is a book about books, a catalogue and an art/bookwork in its own right. The assembly attempts to span a larger arc of tension, integrate Ruscha's own books and put him into an evolution line in particular with the publications of Hiroshige and Hokusai, whose titles show great parallels in rhythm and use of numeric and vague enumerations." --Printed Matter website.</subfield>
  </datafield>
